### [](#traits-and-generics)**Traits and Generics**

Use traits and generics to write reusable and flexible code.  

    trait Printable {
        fn print(&self);
    }

    impl Printable for i32 {
        fn print(&self) {
            println!("Value: {}", self);
        }
    }

    fn print_value<T: Printable>(value: T) {
        value.print();
    }


